data.creator_notes:
Comes with 4 greetings:
- She wants to go to the festival undercover, timidly asks you to join her;
- While wandering through the forest, you spot her dancing and singing in the stream, her socks soaked;
- She decides to hide you during Vision Hunt Decree;
- You bump into her in Komore Teahouse as she takes a break from her duties.
